(RATE-SENTINEL HIGH LEVEL DESIGN \(HLD\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Version: 1.0) Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-07-16) Tj
T*
(Project: rate-sentinel) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. PURPOSE AND SCOPE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Rate-Sentinel is a centralized gateway-side control plane for API protection and shared trust) Tj
T*
(capabilities.) Tj
T*
(It enforces rate limits, authenticates callers, supports OTP workflows, ensures idempotent) Tj
T*
(payment processing,) Tj
T*
(and publishes notification intents to Kafka.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This HLD covers the system context, major components, key data flows, deployment architecture,) Tj
T*
(and) Tj
T*
(cross-cutting concerns. Detailed class-level behavior is documented in the LLD.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. GOALS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Enforce configurable per-client and per-route rate limiting with low latency.) Tj
T*
(- Provide JWT-based authentication and role-protected APIs.) Tj
T*
(- Offer reusable OTP generation and verification with lockout policy.) Tj
T*
(- Prevent duplicate payment execution using idempotency keys.) Tj
T*
(- Decouple notification delivery via asynchronous Kafka event publishing.) Tj
T*
(- Expose operational metrics and health probes for platform observability.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. SYSTEM CONTEXT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(External actors and dependencies:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Client applications and internal services call REST APIs exposed by Rate-Sentinel.) Tj
T*
(- MySQL stores durable business and rule state.) Tj
T*
(- Redis stores fast-changing counters, lock keys, and cache entries.) Tj
T*
(- Kafka receives notification/payment events for downstream processing.) Tj
T*
(- Admin users manage rules through admin endpoints.) Tj
T*
(- Monitoring stack scrapes actuator metrics \(Prometheus format\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. HIGH-LEVEL ARCHITECTURE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Logical layers:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Edge and Security Layer) Tj
T*
(- Spring Security + JWT validation filter.) Tj
T*
(- Rate limiting filter intercepts calls before controller execution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) API and Orchestration Layer) Tj
T*
(- Controllers: Auth, OTP, Payment, Admin Rule Management.) Tj
T*
(- Services: RateLimitService, OTPService, PaymentService, NotificationDispatcherService.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3\) Data and Messaging Layer) Tj
T*
(- MySQL via Spring Data JPA repositories.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
