() Tj
T*
(Fast-state Redis keys:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Sliding window zset keys: `sw:{clientId}:{route}`.) Tj
T*
(- Token bucket keys: token and refill timestamps.) Tj
T*
(- Rule cache keys: `rate-limit-rules::{clientId}:{route}`.) Tj
T*
(- OTP lock keys: `otp:lock:{identifier}`.) Tj
T*
(- Payment idempotency keys: `payment:idem:{idempotencyKey}`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. DEPLOYMENT VIEW) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Containerized local topology from `docker-compose.yml`:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Kafka broker \(KRaft mode\) and Kafka UI.) Tj
T*
(- Redis.) Tj
T*
(- MySQL expected as external dependency \(configured in application properties through env) Tj
T*
(vars\).) Tj
T*
(- Spring Boot application process.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ports \(as configured\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- App: 8080 \(default Spring Boot\)) Tj
T*
(- Kafka broker: 9092/29092) Tj
T*
(- Kafka UI: 8081) Tj
T*
(- Redis: 6379) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. SECURITY AND COMPLIANCE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Stateless JWT auth for protected routes.) Tj
T*
(- BCrypt for OTP storage; no plaintext OTP persistence.) Tj
T*
(- Role protection for admin routes.) Tj
T*
(- Idempotency pattern mitigates duplicate financial processing risk.) Tj
T*
(- Secrets are externalized through environment variables and expected vault integration in) Tj
T*
(production.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. OBSERVABILITY AND OPERABILITY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Health endpoints and readiness checks via Spring Actuator.) Tj
T*
(- Prometheus metrics exported at `/actuator/prometheus`.) Tj
T*
(- Counters include rate-limit pass/throttle events and service-domain events.) Tj
T*
(- Response headers expose real-time quota context to clients.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11. RISKS AND MITIGATIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Risk: Caller identity mismatch causes unexpected rule misses.) Tj
T*
(  Mitigation: wildcard and pattern rules, plus debug logs for identity and route.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Risk: Concurrency overshoot in quota checks.) Tj
T*
(  Mitigation: atomic Redis Lua script in sliding-window implementation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Risk: Duplicate payment retries.) Tj
T*
(  Mitigation: Redis + DB idempotency check with TTL and unique key constraint.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
