(12. ASSUMPTIONS AND OUT OF SCOPE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Outbound notification delivery is handled by downstream consumers, not this service.) Tj
T*
(- OAuth/OIDC, user lifecycle, and refund processing are not in current scope.) Tj
T*
(- Multi-region active-active deployment is out of scope for v1.) Tj
